OL,3,GNEWSANew theatre centre 'vitally
OL,4,Aimportant', says actor
OL,5,
OL,6,FBAFTA-nominated actor Josh O'Connor
OL,7,Fsays a new theatre education centre in
OL,8,Fhis hometown is "vitally important" for
OL,9,Fyoung, aspiring actors.
OL,11,FO'Connor, who is reported to be in the
OL,12,Frunning to be the next James Bond,
OL,13,Fofficially opened the new #1m Everyman
OL,14,FTheatre education centre in Cheltenham,
OL,15,Fwhere he grew up, earlier.
OL,17,FThe centre sits in a former community
OL,18,Fvenue and will be used to help give
OL,19,Feveryone access to the performing arts.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
