OL,3,GNEWSANew theatre centre 'vitally
OL,4,Aimportant', says actor
OL,5,
OL,6,FO'Connor, who attended Everyman's youth
OL,7,Ftheatre, said: "It's an incredible gift
OL,8,Fto be able to learn to do drama."
